fe after death.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ peace = \u00f6r\u00f6k b\u00e9ke (pl. The treaty aimed to establish _______ peace in the region.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ glory = \u00f6r\u00f6k dics\u0151s\u00e9g (pl. The hero achieved _______ glory for his bravery.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ time = \u00f6r\u00f6kk\u00e9val\u00f3s\u00e1g (pl. He felt like he was waiting for _______ time.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>eternal<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>eternal<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>eternally<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>eternity<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: eternal love \/ eternal life \/ eternal flame \/ eternal damnation<\/span><\/p><p>similar: everlasting \/ perpetual \/ immortal \/ endless<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: temporary \/ transient \/ finite<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10","due_at":"2026-05-13T15:35:22+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-09T18:13:42+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-07"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"6 nap","easy":"8 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T15:27:47+00:00"},{"id":51289,"front":"<p>I _______ your call; please let me know when you&#039;re free to chat. <em>(v\u00e1rom \/ v\u00e1rakozom)<\/em><\/p><p>The committee&#039;s decision on the new policy is eagerly _______ by all stakeholders. <em>(v\u00e1rja \/ el\u0151re l\u00e1tja)<\/em><\/p><p>A significant challenge _______ the research team as they delve deeper into the complex data. <em>(v\u00e1r \/ el\u0151tt\u00fck \u00e1ll)<\/em><\/p><p>In the quiet of the morning, she sat by the window, _______ the first rays of dawn. <em>(v\u00e1rva \/ lesve)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">v\u00e1r \/ v\u00e1rakozik \/ el\u0151tt \u00e1ll<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elker\u00fcl \/ kiker\u00fcl \/ megsz\u00f6kik<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 eagerly _______ = t\u00fcrelmetlen\u00fcl v\u00e1r (pl. We eagerly _______ the results of the competition.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ your arrival = v\u00e1rja az \u00e9rkez\u00e9s\u00e9t (pl. They will _______ your arrival at the airport.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a decision = d\u00f6nt\u00e9sre v\u00e1r (pl. The whole country is awaiting a decision from the government.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a response = v\u00e1laszra v\u00e1r (pl. I am still _______ a response to my email.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>await<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>await<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: eagerly await \/ await your arrival \/ await a decision \/ await a response<\/span><\/p><p>similar: wait for \/ expect \/ anticipate \/ look forward to<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: avoid \/ dodge \/ evade<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-09","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-11T13:12:50+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-10T17:20:01+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-09","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T13:12:32+00:00"},{"id":51282,"fr