tep":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-08","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-13T15:30:30+00:00"},{"id":51267,"front":"<p>He was so tired that he started to _______ loudly as soon as he lay down. <em>(horkol \/ hangosan l\u00e9legzik alv\u00e1s k\u00f6zben)<\/em><\/p><p>The doctor asked if the patient experienced any nocturnal respiratory disturbances, such as _______ or sleep apnea. <em>(horkol\u00e1s \/ l\u00e9gz\u00e9si rendelleness\u00e9g alv\u00e1s alatt)<\/em><\/p><p>The gentle rhythm of the waves was almost drowned out by the persistent _______ of the man in the next bunk. <em>(horkol\u00e1s \/ hangos alv\u00e1si l\u00e9gz\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study investigated the acoustic properties of _______ patterns in relation to sleep quality. <em>(horkol\u00e1s \/ hangos alv\u00e1si l\u00e9gz\u00e9s mint\u00e1zata)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">horkol \/ horkol\u00e1s \/ hangosan l\u00e9legzik \/ durmol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): csendes alv\u00e1s \/ nyugodt l\u00e9gz\u00e9s \/ csend<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ loudly = hangosan horkol (pl. He began to _______ loudly after only a few minutes.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 stop _______ = abbahagyja a horkol\u00e1st (pl. I wish he would _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ in your sleep = horkol az alv\u00e1sodban (pl. She told me I _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a loud _______ = hangos horkol\u00e1s (pl. The room was filled with a loud _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>snore<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>snore<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>snore<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: loud snore \/ stop snoring \/ snore loudly \/ snoring sound<\/span><\/p><p>similar: snort \/ wheeze \/ gasp<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: sleep quietly \/ breathe silently \/ be silent<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"ease_factor":265,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10","due_at":"2026-05-14T15:24:27+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-10T09:50:23+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-08"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"11 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T15:22:07+00:00"},{"id":51274,"front":"<p>The politician&#039;s affair caused a huge public _______. <em>(botr\u00e1ny \/ szenz\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The company was involved in a financial _______ that led to its collapse. <em>(vissza\u00e9l\u00e9s \/ \u00fcgy \/ botr\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigation uncovered a deep-seated _______ within the organization. <em>(\u00f6sszeesk\u00fcv\u00e9s \/ rossz \u00fcgy \/ botr\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel&#039;s plot revolved around a dark family _______ that haunted generations. <em>(titok \/ sz\u00e9gyenfolt \/ botr\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">botr\u00e1ny \/ szenz\u00e1ci\u00f3 \/ \u00fcgy \/ vissza\u00e9l\u00e9s \/ sz\u00e9gyenfolt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztess\u00e9g \/ becs\u00fclet \/ er\u00e9ny<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cause a _______ = botr\u00e1nyt okoz (pl. The news caused a huge scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai botr\u00e1ny (pl. The minister resigned after the political scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 financial _______ = p\u00e9nz\u00fcgyi botr\u00e1ny (pl. The company faced a major financial scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ erupts = kit\u00f6r a botr\u00e1ny (pl. A new scandal erupted in the government.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______-hit = botr\u00e1nyt\u00f3l s\u00fajtott (pl. The scandal-hit celebrity tried to avoid the press.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>scandal<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>scandal<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: political scandal \/ financial scandal \/ public scandal \/ sex scandal<\/span><\/p><p>similar: outrage \/ disgrace \/ shock \/ controversy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: honor \/ integrity \/ virtue<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"scandal","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-06","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-11T09:46:11+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-10T16:22:49+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-06","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-13T15:30:41+00:00"},{"id":51292,"front":"<p>I need to take out a _______ from the bank to buy a new car. <em>(k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n \/ hitelt)<\/em><\/p><p>The library offers a free book _______ service to its members. <em>(k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nz\u00e9s \/ k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nad\u00e1si)<\/em><\/p><p>The government approved a substantial _______ to the developing nation for infrastructure projects. <em>(hitelt \/ k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nt)<\/em><\/p><p>Can I _______ you my umbrella? It looks like it&#039;s going to rain. <em>(k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nadom \/ odaadom)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n \/ hitel \/ k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n\u00f6z<\/span><\/p><p><span style=