_______. <em>(el\u0151szoba \/ k\u00f6zleked\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The architect designed a long, grand _______ leading to the main ballroom. <em>(folyos\u00f3 \/ csarnok)<\/em><\/p><p>During the fire drill, all occupants were instructed to proceed calmly through the designated _______ to the nearest exit. <em>(kij\u00e1rat \/ k\u00f6zleked\u0151 \u00fat)<\/em><\/p><p>A faint scent of old paper and dust lingered in the dimly lit _______ of the ancient library. <em>(folyos\u00f3 \/ \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">folyos\u00f3 \/ el\u0151szoba \/ k\u00f6zleked\u0151 \/ \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ gang<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szoba \/ sarok \/ fal<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 long _______ = hossz\u00fa folyos\u00f3 (pl. The hotel had a very long _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 narrow _______ = sz\u0171k folyos\u00f3 (pl. We had to squeeze through the narrow _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 dark _______ = s\u00f6t\u00e9t folyos\u00f3 (pl. He walked down the dark _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 empty _______ = \u00fcres folyos\u00f3 (pl. The empty _______ echoed with his footsteps.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 up the _______ = fel a folyos\u00f3n (pl. She ran up the _______ to her room.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hallway<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>hallway<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: long hallway \/ narrow hallway \/ dark hallway \/ empty hallway<\/span><\/p><p>similar: corridor \/ passage \/ hall \/ aisle<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: room \/ chamber \/ space<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-01","reviewed_on":"2026-