u00f6lds\u00e9g \/ k\u00f6ret alap)<\/em><\/p><p>Nutritional studies often analyze the bioavailability of iron in _______. <em>(vasban gazdag n\u00f6v\u00e9ny \/ t\u00e1pl\u00e1lkoz\u00e1si kutat\u00e1s t\u00e1rgya)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient Romans were known to cultivate _______ for its medicinal properties. <em>(gy\u00f3gyhat\u00e1s\u00fa lev\u00e9lz\u00f6lds\u00e9g \/ t\u00f6rt\u00e9nelmi n\u00f6v\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">spen\u00f3t \/ paraj \/ spen\u00f3tlev\u00e9l \/ z\u00f6lds\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): gy\u00fcm\u00f6lcs \/ h\u00fas \/ kem\u00e9ny\u00edt\u0151<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 fresh _______ = friss spen\u00f3t (pl. Add a handful of fresh _______ to your pasta.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cooked _______ = f\u0151tt spen\u00f3t (pl. Creamed _______ is a classic side dish.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ salad = spen\u00f3tsal\u00e1ta (pl. She made a delicious _______ salad with strawberries and feta.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ leaves = spen\u00f3tlevelek (pl. Wash the _______ thoroughly before using.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>spinach<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>spinach<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: spinach and feta \/ creamed spinach \/ spinach salad \/ baby spinach<\/span><\/p><p>similar: paraj \/ spinach leaves \/ leafy green<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: fruit \/ meat \/ root vegetable<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10","due_at":"2026-05-13T15:32:48+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-09T18:14:18+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":25