nd<\/span><\/p><p>similar: snort \/ wheeze \/ gasp<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: sleep quietly \/ breathe silently \/ be silent<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"ease_factor":265,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10","due_at":"2026-05-14T15:22:07+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-10T09:47:36+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-08"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"11 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T15:24:27+00:00"},{"id":51268,"front":"<p>He&#039;s so _______, he never changes his mind even when he&#039;s wrong. <em>(makacs \/ merev)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the overwhelming evidence, the committee remained _______ in its decision. <em>(hajthatatlan \/ kitart\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The research highlights the _______ nature of certain societal attitudes, resisting reform. <em>(kem\u00e9ny \/ rugalmatlan)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ refusal to compromise threatened to derail the entire negotiation. <em>(szil\u00e1rd \/ engedetlen)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">makacs \/ kem\u00e9ny \/ merev \/ hajthatatlan \/ szil\u00e1rd<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): enged\u00e9keny \/ rugalmas \/ nyitott<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ child = makacs gyerek (pl. My _______ child refuses to eat vegetables.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to = valamihez ragaszkod\u00f3 (pl. He&#039;s _______ to his old ways.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ refusal = makacs visszautas\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. Her _______ refusal to cooperate was frustrating.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ attitude = makacs hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s (pl. The _______ attitude of the management made progress difficult.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stubborn<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>stubborn<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>stubbornly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>stubbornness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: stubborn mule \/ stubborn fact \/ stubborn stain \/ stubborn resistance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: obstinate \/ unyielding \/ inflexible \/ headstrong<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: flexible \/ compliant \/ amenable<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-11T10:45:10+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-10T18:35:06+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T16:47:50+00:00"},{"id":51259,"front":"<p>They say that true love is _______. <em>(\u00f6r\u00f6k \/ v\u00e9gtelen)<\/em><\/p><p>The company is seeking an _______ solution to its financial problems. <em>(hossz\u00fa t\u00e1v\u00fa \/ tart\u00f3s)<\/em><\/p><p>Philosophers have debated the nature of _______ existence for centuries. <em>(\u00f6r\u00f6kk\u00e9val\u00f3 \/ halhatatlan)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient ruins whispered tales of an _______ empire. <em>(id\u0151tlen \/ \u00f6r\u00f6kk\u00e9val\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00f6r\u00f6k \/ v\u00e9gtelen \/ halhatatlan \/ id\u0151tlen \/ tart\u00f3s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): muland\u00f3 \/ ideiglenes \/ v\u00e9ges<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ love = \u00f6r\u00f6k szerelem (pl. They promised each other _______ love.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ life = \u00f6r\u00f6k \u00e9let (pl. Many religions promise _______ life after death.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ peace = \u00f6r\u00f6k b\u00e9ke (pl. The treaty aimed to establish _______ peace in the region.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ glory = \u00f6r\u00f6k dics\u0151s\u00e9g (pl. The hero achieved _______ glory for his bravery.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ time = \u00f6r\u00f6kk\u00e9val\u00f3s\u00e1g (pl. He felt like he was waiting for _______ time.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>eternal<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>eternal<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>eternally<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>eternity<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: eternal love \/ eternal life \/ eternal flame \/ eternal damnation<\/span><\/p><p>similar: everlasting \/ perpetual \/ immortal \/ endless<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: temporary \/ transient \/ finite<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10","due_at":"2026-05-13T15:27:47+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-09T18:14:35+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-07"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"6 nap","easy":"8 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T15:35:22+00:00"},{"id":51273,"front":"<p>I am _______ informing you that your application has been approved. <em>(ezennel \/ ez\u00e1ltal)<\/em><\/p><p>The company _______ declares its commitment to sustainability. <em>(ez\u00faton \/ hivatalosan)<\/em><\/p><p>This document _______ grants the recipient full access to the archives. <em>(t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyesen \/ jogilag)<\/em><\/p><p>He _______ bequeathed his entire fortune to his alma mater. <em>(v\u00e9grendeletileg \/ hivatalosan)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ezennel \/ ez\u00e1ltal \/ ez\u00faton \/ ezennel fogva \/ ezennel is<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nem hivatalosan \/ inform\u00e1lisan \/ sz\u00f3ban<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ inform = ezennel t\u00e1j\u00e9koztat (pl. I am _______ informing you of the changes.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ declare = ezennel kijelent (pl. The committee _______ declares the motion passed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ grant = ezennel megad (pl. This permit _______ grants you permission to enter.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ appoint = ezennel kinevez (pl. The board _______ appoints him as the new CEO.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hereby<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: hereby inform \/ hereby declare \/ hereby grant \/ hereby appoint<\/span><\/p><p>similar: by this means \/ thus \/ hence \/ thereby<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: informally \/ unofficially \/ verbally<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"hereby","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-07","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-11T13:46:15+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-10T17:33:26+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-07","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T15:21:42+00:00"},{"id":51280,"front":"<p>She asked a friend to _______ her to the party. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9r \/ elmegy vele)<\/em><\/p><p>The diplomat was provided with an armed _______ for his protection. <em>(test\u0151r \/ biztos\u00edt\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study examined the role of a mentor as an _______ for junior researchers. <em>(ir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3 \/ seg\u00edt\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>As the ship sailed into the harbor, a smaller tugboat came to _______ it safely to the dock. <em>(vezetni \/ seg\u00edteni a man\u0151verez\u00e9sben)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00eds\u00e9r \/ v\u00e9d \/ k\u00eds\u00e9ret \/ seg\u00edt \/ vezet<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhagy \/ mag\u00e1ra hagy \/ nem seg\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone to a place = valakit elvinni\/elvezetni egy helyre (pl. He will escort you to your seat.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 provide an _______ = biztos\u00edtani valakit\/valamit (pl. The VIP was provided with an escort.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ service = k\u00eds\u00e9r\u0151 szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1s (pl. The hotel offers a complimentary escort service.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a ship = haj\u00f3t k\u00eds\u00e9rni\/vezetni (pl. The pilot will escort the ship into port.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: bodyguard escort \/ security escort \/ military escort \/ police escort<\/span><\/p><p>similar: accompany \/ guide \/ shepherd \/ convoy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: abandon \/ leave \/ forsake<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"escort","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-08","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-12T07:47:18+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-10T21:22:38+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-08","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-12T07:44:00+00:00"},{"id":51264,"front":"<p>After the big meal, my stomach felt heavy, and I could feel my _______ working hard to digest the food. <em>(szerv (em\u00e9szt\u00e9s) \/ bels\u0151 szerv)<\/em><\/p><p>The autopsy revealed significant damage to the patient&#039;s _______, likely caused by long-term alcohol abuse. <em>(szerv (orvosi kontextus) \/ m\u00e1j)<\/em><\/p><p>In many cultures, the _______ is considered a vital organ responsible for detoxification and metabolism. <em>(szerv (biol\u00f3giai\/eg\u00e9szs\u00e9g\u00fcgyi kontextus) \/ m\u00e1j)<\/em><\/p><p>The hunter carefully removed the _______ from the deer, intending to cook it later. <em>(\u00e1llati szerv (gasztron\u00f3mia) \/ m\u00e1j)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">m\u00e1j \/ gan\u00e9 \/ vese \/ gyomor \/ t\u00fcd\u0151<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): sz\u00edv \/ agy \/ t\u00fcd\u0151<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 fatty _______ = zs\u00edros m\u00e1j (pl. He was diagnosed with fatty _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ disease = m\u00e1jbetegs\u00e9g (pl. Alcohol is a major cause of _______ disease.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ transplant = m\u00e1jtranszplant\u00e1ci\u00f3 (pl. She is on the waiting list for a _______ transplant.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ cancer = m\u00e1jr\u00e1k (pl. Early detection of _______ cancer can improve survival rates.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>liver<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>liver<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: liver disease \/ fatty liver \/ liver transplant \/ liver cancer<\/span><\/p><p>similar: hepatic organ \/ viscus \/ gland \/ organ<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: heart \/ brain \/ lungs<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-14T07:46:53+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-10T20:44:25+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-08"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"6 nap","easy":"8 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T09:48:59+00:00"},{"id":51270,"front":"<p>The hotel had a lot of _______ rooms, so we got a good deal. <em>(\u00fcres \/ szabad)<\/em><\/p><p>Please ensure all positions are filled; we cannot leave any _______. <em>(bet\u00f6ltetlen \/ \u00fcresed\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study found that a significant percentage of laboratory equipment remained _______ for extended periods. <em>(haszn\u00e1laton k\u00edv\u00fcli \/ nem haszn\u00e1lt)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient manor stood silent, its grand halls _______ and echoing with the ghosts of its past. <em>(elhagyatott \/ l\u00e1togat\u00f3kt\u00f3l mentes)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00fcres \/ szabad \/ bet\u00f6ltetlen \/ elhagyatott \/ nem foglalt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): foglalt \/ betelt \/ haszn\u00e1lt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ room = \u00fcres szoba (pl. The hotel has many vacant rooms.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ position = bet\u00f6ltetlen \u00e1ll\u00e1s (pl. There are several vacant positions in the company.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ seat = szabad \u00fcl\u0151hely (pl. Is this seat vacant?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ property = \u00fcres ingatlan (pl. The council is trying to redevelop vacant property.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>vacant<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>vacant<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>vacance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: vacant room \/ vacant position \/ vacant seat \/ vacant lot<\/span><\/p><p>similar: empty \/ unoccupied \/ available \/ free<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: occupied \/ full \/ taken<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#f264ed","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11","due_at":"2026-05-11T07:48:10+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-10T17:23:02+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-10"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T13:45:19+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/38\/study","version":"0f84ec1ca006530937cbef6839cb50d3","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div><?php /**PATH /Applications/XAMPP/xamppfiles/htdocs/topEwords/storage/framework/views/85970b457ad620aeb26e60382151d50f.blade.php ENDPATH**/ ?>